Z||000008||Standard||12-03-2000||02:11 AM||||Definatly the summer.  Preferably a little later in the season so I can have my GT looking decent...  <P>We could invade the auto-crosses at the Dakota County Technical College, I would put in the link for the Minnesota Autosports Club because it has all the info on the auto-x but it's down.. the closest strip that I know of would be the Brainard International Raceway.. of course, I don't know if they have a strip or not...  The MN guys at LS1.com are always heading out to Rock Falls, WI for the strip there..<P>Might want to contact <A HREF="http://www.deskmedia.com/basso" TARGET=_blank>Basso Presto</A> , a sports car club located in Mankato.  I would hope they would show some interest in it.  <P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 153,000 miles and some busted up ground f/x  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/redface.gif"> <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif"> ||||reg||1
